{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 133,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "每当我回想起幼年的时候\nWhenever I look back on my early childhood,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3600,
    "dDurationMs": 3733,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我就觉得我的幼年无比快乐\nI feel that my childhood was incomparably happy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 8333,
    "dDurationMs": 2533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "幼年总是会结束的\nChildhood always comes to an end;"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 11233,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "一定要适应长大的生活\nyou have to get used to life as a grown-up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 15733,
    "dDurationMs": 3333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这是8岁时的我写的\nThis was written by me at eight years old."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 19433,
    "dDurationMs": 5233,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我8岁的时候就开始怀念我的幼年了\nAt eight I had already begun to feel nostalgic about my childhood."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 24966,
    "dDurationMs": 3967,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "最近我在我的爸妈家里翻到了\nRecently, at my parents' house, I dug out"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 28933,
    "dDurationMs": 5533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这些从小学到高中的作文本\nthese composition notebooks, from primary school all the way to high school."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 35100,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "7岁到17岁\nFrom age seven to seventeen."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 38333,
    "dDurationMs": 2433,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我真的没想到他们还留着\nI really didn't expect them to have kept them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 41033,
    "dDurationMs": 2867,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "所以今天我想跟你们一起看一看\nSo today I want to look through them with you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 44233,
    "dDurationMs": 2633,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "一个中国小孩是怎么\nand see how a Chinese child"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 46866,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "一点一点学会用中文写作的\nlearns, bit by bit, to write in Chinese."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 51833,
    "dDurationMs": 4133,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "每一个在中国上小学或者中学的人\nEveryone who goes to primary or secondary school in China"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 56466,
    "dDurationMs": 2434,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "都必须写作文\nhas to write compositions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 59833,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "都必须用作文通过语文考试\nEveryone has to pass their Chinese exams through composition."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 64733,
    "dDurationMs": 4767,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "小时候我们什么都写。写人，写动物\nAs kids we wrote about everything: about people, about animals,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 69533,
    "dDurationMs": 5600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "写植物，写一次经历，写景，写日记\nabout plants, about an experience, about scenery, diary entries."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 75700,
    "dDurationMs": 3366,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "后来还会写调查、议论文\nLater we also wrote surveys and argumentative essays."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 79166,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "在我的印象里\nAs I remember it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 80766,
    "dDurationMs": 2467,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "不管是小学还是中学\nwhether in primary or in secondary school,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 83633,
    "dDurationMs": 3667,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "每个星期我们都要练习写作文\nevery single week we had to practise writing a composition."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 88033,
    "dDurationMs": 1167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "写完以后\nAnd once we'd finished,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 89300,
    "dDurationMs": 5100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "老师还会批改、打分、写评语\nthe teacher would correct it, grade it and write comments."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 95233,
    "dDurationMs": 4167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "那你们可以看到我有这么多的作文本\nSo, as you can see, I have this many composition notebooks."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 100000,
    "dDurationMs": 1833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "应该你们也会好奇\nYou're probably wondering:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 102633,
    "dDurationMs": 1100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "为什么呢？\nwhy?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 104266,
    "dDurationMs": 2134,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "写作文很重要吗？\nIs writing compositions really that important?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 106800,
    "dDurationMs": 2033,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "是的。因为\nYes, it is. Because"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 108833,
    "dDurationMs": 1967,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "在当时的语文考试里\nin the Chinese exams back then,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 111133,
    "dDurationMs": 3867,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "作文一般是很大很大的一个部分\nthe composition was usually a very, very big part of it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 115000,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我们甚至会有一句比较夸张的话\nWe even have a rather exaggerated saying:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 118833,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "得作文者得天下\n\"He who wins the composition wins the world.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 122700,
    "dDurationMs": 1633,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "意思差不多就是\nIt means roughly that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 124633,
    "dDurationMs": 2267,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "如果你的作文成绩好\nif you do well on the composition,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 127400,
    "dDurationMs": 3533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "你的语文成绩差不多就稳了一半\nhalf of your Chinese grade is pretty much secured."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 131466,
    "dDurationMs": 834,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "不过\nBut then —"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 133133,
    "dDurationMs": 2333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "小学中学时的我\ndid I, back in primary and secondary school,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 135533,
    "dDurationMs": 2333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "真的喜欢写作文吗？\nreally enjoy writing compositions?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 138866,
    "dDurationMs": 2534,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "真的能写出好作文吗？\nCould I really write good ones?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 142500,
    "dDurationMs": 2333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "今天我就想和你们一起来\nToday I'd like to sit down with you and read"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 144833,
    "dDurationMs": 4467,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "读一读不同年级的我写的几篇作文\na few compositions I wrote in different school years."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 149633,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "第一篇作文\nThe first composition:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 151666,
    "dDurationMs": 1467,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "二年级的\nsecond grade,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 153233,
    "dDurationMs": 1967,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "8岁的我写的\nwritten when I was eight."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 155900,
    "dDurationMs": 2366,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "题目叫《西瓜》\nThe title is \"Watermelon\"."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 158900,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "当时的老师给了我一个优\nMy teacher gave it an \"excellent\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 161833,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "加三颗星\nplus three stars."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 165233,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我最喜欢吃的水果是西瓜\nMy favourite fruit is watermelon."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 169466,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "西瓜又大又圆\nA watermelon is big and round,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 171933,
    "dDurationMs": 2067,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "像个大皮球\nlike a big rubber ball."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 174833,
    "dDurationMs": 2467,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "它有一条小辫子\nIt has a little pigtail,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 177533,
    "dDurationMs": 1533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "又细又短\nthin and short,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 179333,
    "dDurationMs": 2067,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "像小猪的尾巴\nlike a piglet's tail."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 181666,
    "dDurationMs": 4867,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "熟透的西瓜穿着一件浓淡相间的衣服\nA fully ripe watermelon wears a coat of alternating dark and light stripes,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 187466,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "上面还点缀着一个个黑色的小斑纹\ndotted all over with tiny black markings."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 192233,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "外形真是好看极了\nIts shape really is lovely."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 195000,
    "dDurationMs": 4933,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我本来以为8岁的我中文会特别简单\nI'd assumed that my Chinese at eight would be very simple,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 200000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "特别幼稚\nvery childish."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 201433,
    "dDurationMs": 1467,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "可是打开一看\nBut when I opened it up,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 202900,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "并不是这样的\nthat wasn't the case at all."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 204833,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "里面还有很多比喻\nThere are plenty of similes in it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 207133,
    "dDurationMs": 1300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "很多复杂的\nplenty of complicated adjectives"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 208433,
    "dDurationMs": 2633,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "可能你们也不知道的形容词\nthat you might not even know."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 211533,
    "dDurationMs": 1100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "为什么呢？\nWhy is that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 212900,
    "dDurationMs": 1766,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "现在我想起来了\nNow I remember."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 214933,
    "dDurationMs": 4867,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "当时一年级二年级刚进小学的时候\nBack in first and second grade, when we'd only just started primary school,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 220100,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我们怎么可能会\nhow could we possibly"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 222200,
    "dDurationMs": 2466,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "一开始就直接写作文呀\nhave written compositions straight away?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 225333,
    "dDurationMs": 3133,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "当时的老师肯定是让我们先去模仿\nOur teachers must have had us imitate first."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 229033,
    "dDurationMs": 2033,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我们要学会模仿\nWe had to learn to imitate,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 231466,
    "dDurationMs": 4167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "让自己写出来的中文像作文\nso that the Chinese we wrote read like a composition"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 236033,
    "dDurationMs": 3167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "而不像直接嘴巴说出来的\nand not like something straight out of our mouths."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 240000,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我们模仿学到的课文\nWe imitated the texts we'd studied,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 243300,
    "dDurationMs": 2633,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "模仿老师教给我们的表达\nimitated the expressions our teachers taught us,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 246333,
    "dDurationMs": 2567,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "努力去用新学的词语\nand tried hard to use the words we'd just learnt."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 249533,
    "dDurationMs": 2733,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "那个阶段是不是和你们\nIsn't that stage a little like"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 252333,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "学中文的时候有点像呢？\nthe way you learn Chinese?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 266733,
    "dDurationMs": 1567,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "第二篇作文\nThe second composition,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 268500,
    "dDurationMs": 1700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "三年级写的\nwritten in third grade,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 270533,
    "dDurationMs": 2133,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "当时我9岁\nwhen I was nine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 275100,
    "dDurationMs": 1766,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "陪表妹玩\n\"Playing with My Little Cousin\"."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 277466,
    "dDurationMs": 1434,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "每个礼拜天\nEvery Sunday"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 279066,
    "dDurationMs": 3167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "表妹都要来我家玩、吃饭\nmy cousin comes to our house to play and to eat."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 283000,
    "dDurationMs": 2266,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "表妹是我舅舅的女儿\nMy cousin is my uncle's daughter."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 285466,
    "dDurationMs": 1734,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "刚满4周岁\nShe's just turned four,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 287800,
    "dDurationMs": 1866,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "废话却一箩筐\nbut she talks a whole basketful of nonsense."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 290400,
    "dDurationMs": 1866,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "一箩筐的废话\nA whole basketful of nonsense."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 293200,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这天表妹又来了\nThat day my cousin came over again."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 296666,
    "dDurationMs": 2734,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "那时我正在做作业\nI was doing my homework at the time"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 300066,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "不想陪她玩\nand didn't want to play with her."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 302300,
    "dDurationMs": 1333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "可是不陪\nBut if I didn't,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 303866,
    "dDurationMs": 2467,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "老妈又要唠叨半天\nMum would nag me for ages."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 306833,
    "dDurationMs": 2833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我只好不情愿的答应了\nSo I reluctantly agreed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 312633,
    "dDurationMs": 2433,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "表妹拿出我的一些玩具\nMy cousin took out some of my toys"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 315500,
    "dDurationMs": 1766,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "叫我做病人\nand told me to be the patient"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 317400,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "她做医生\nwhile she was the doctor."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 319633,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "又叫我到她跟前\nThen she told me to come over to her,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 322200,
    "dDurationMs": 5333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "她装模作样的给我打针开药\nand made a great show of giving me injections and prescribing medicine,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 327933,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "搞得我哭笑不得\nwhich left me not knowing whether to laugh or cry."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 332033,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "她又要玩超市游戏\nThen she wanted to play supermarket."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 334800,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "表妹让我当顾客\nMy cousin had me be the customer"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 336833,
    "dDurationMs": 1467,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "她当服务员\nand she was the shop assistant."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 339200,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我拿出一些要买的物品给表妹\nI took out some things I wanted to buy and handed them to her."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 343433,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "她用我的电话碰一下物品\nShe tapped each item with my phone,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 347100,
    "dDurationMs": 3933,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我假装拿出一些钱给她\nand I pretended to take out some money and give it to her."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 351600,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "她接过钱，把物品给我\nShe took the money and handed me the goods."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 356000,
    "dDurationMs": 1833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "吃饭的时间到了\nWhen it was time to eat,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 357833,
    "dDurationMs": 2767,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我终于不用陪她玩了\nI finally didn't have to play with her any more."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 360866,
    "dDurationMs": 1434,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "谢天谢地\nThank goodness."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 362733,
    "dDurationMs": 2867,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "当时的我还贴心的提醒老师\nLittle me even thoughtfully reminded the teacher:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 365866,
    "dDurationMs": 1434,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "反面还有\n\"There's more on the back.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 367466,
    "dDurationMs": 2734,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这篇作文还没有结束呢\nThe composition wasn't finished yet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 372600,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "哎，你说这个表妹烦不烦？\nHonestly, wasn't that cousin annoying?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 378100,
    "dDurationMs": 4333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "说实话，我看到题目《陪表妹玩》的时候\nTo be honest, when I saw the title \"Playing with My Little Cousin\","
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 382633,
    "dDurationMs": 1233,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我真的没有想到\nI really didn't expect"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 383866,
    "dDurationMs": 3267,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这是一篇有一点抱怨的作文\nit to be a composition with a hint of complaint in it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 387433,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "但是是很真实的情绪\nBut the feelings in it are very real,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 390066,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "是很真实的故事\nand the story is very real."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 392133,
    "dDurationMs": 2333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我读的时候感觉自己\nAs I read it, I felt as if"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 394466,
    "dDurationMs": 2534,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "仿佛回到了那个时候\nI'd gone right back to that time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 397333,
    "dDurationMs": 1367,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "三年级的我\nThird-grade me,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 398866,
    "dDurationMs": 1367,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "9岁的我\nnine-year-old me,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 400333,
    "dDurationMs": 2933,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "没有再继续模仿写作文了\nwas no longer writing compositions by imitation,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 403433,
    "dDurationMs": 4300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "而是开始真正写发生在自己身上的事\nbut had started to write, for real, about things that happened to me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 408700,
    "dDurationMs": 1366,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "哎，现在想想\nCome to think of it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 410066,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我的表妹也已经成年了\nmy cousin is a grown-up now too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 413100,
    "dDurationMs": 2433,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "但当时的我俩其实都是\nBut back then the two of us were really"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 415666,
    "dDurationMs": 2134,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "差不了太多的小孩子\njust children, not that far apart in age."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 418333,
    "dDurationMs": 2167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "三年级的时候还有一篇作文\nThere's another third-grade composition"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 420500,
    "dDurationMs": 1766,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我也想跟你们分享\nthat I'd also like to share with you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 422833,
    "dDurationMs": 2433,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "题目叫《我的自画像》\nIt's called \"My Self-Portrait\"."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 426433,
    "dDurationMs": 2067,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "不是真的是一幅画\nNot an actual painting —"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 428666,
    "dDurationMs": 2667,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "是一篇介绍自己的作文\nit's a composition introducing yourself."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 432500,
    "dDurationMs": 2833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我是一个平凡的女孩\nI am an ordinary girl."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 435733,
    "dDurationMs": 2333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "今年8周岁了\nThis year I turned eight."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 438533,
    "dDurationMs": 2467,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我梳着蘑菇头\nI wear my hair in a mushroom cut."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 441466,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "鼻子小小的\nMy nose is small,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 443900,
    "dDurationMs": 1833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "眼睛也很小\nand my eyes are small too,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 446266,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "但是很有神\nbut they're very bright and lively."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 449233,
    "dDurationMs": 2167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我这个人急性子\nI'm an impatient sort of person;"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 452066,
    "dDurationMs": 2367,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "做什么事都匆匆忙忙\nI do everything in a rush."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 454733,
    "dDurationMs": 1967,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "但我很有好奇心\nBut I'm very curious:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 457066,
    "dDurationMs": 4067,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "一有什么新鲜事就跑上去凑热闹\nthe moment anything new happens, I run over to join in."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 462400,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我呀，兴趣爱好多着呢\nAs for me, I've got plenty of hobbies:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 465666,
    "dDurationMs": 3567,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "书法、钢琴、素描、英语\ncalligraphy, piano, sketching, English."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 469800,
    "dDurationMs": 2933,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "每天晚上都要练一小时钢琴\nEvery evening I have to practise an hour of piano"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 472733,
    "dDurationMs": 3267,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "一小时书法，真累呀\nand an hour of calligraphy. So tiring!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 476800,
    "dDurationMs": 3533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我最喜欢的运动是跑步、排球\nMy favourite sports are running and volleyball."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 480800,
    "dDurationMs": 1333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这就是我\nThat's me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 482333,
    "dDurationMs": 2733,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "你愿意和我做朋友吗？\nWould you like to be my friend?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 486033,
    "dDurationMs": 2633,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "当时的老师还给了一个评语\nMy teacher also left a comment:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 489133,
    "dDurationMs": 4167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "作文如有具体实例来写自己的特点\n\"If the composition used concrete examples to show your characteristics,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 493633,
    "dDurationMs": 1567,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "就生动了\nit would come alive.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 495700,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "然后给了我一个优减\nAnd then she gave me an \"excellent minus\"."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 497966,
    "dDurationMs": 3534,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "你们可别小看这个减号的力量\nDon't underestimate the power of that little minus sign."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 502033,
    "dDurationMs": 5033,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "当时的“优减”对我来说比“优”差多了\nBack then, an \"excellent minus\" felt far worse to me than an \"excellent\","
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 507300,
    "dDurationMs": 2733,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "就像c和a的差别一样\nlike the difference between a C and an A."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 510633,
    "dDurationMs": 2867,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "但现在看着这篇自我介绍\nBut looking at this self-introduction now,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 513866,
    "dDurationMs": 4167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "感觉现在的我和当时差别也不大嘛\ntoday's me doesn't seem all that different from back then."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 518866,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "可能只是发型变了\nMaybe just the hairstyle has changed,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 521300,
    "dDurationMs": 1766,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "更加有耐心了\nand I've become more patient."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 523466,
    "dDurationMs": 2467,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "但是还是想找人做朋友\nBut I still want to find people to be friends with."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 525933,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "但是我觉得现在对我来说\nThough I do feel that these days,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 529200,
    "dDurationMs": 2766,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "自我介绍真的没那么容易了\nintroducing myself really isn't so easy any more."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 532033,
    "dDurationMs": 1733,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "有好多想说的\nThere's so much I want to say"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 533766,
    "dDurationMs": 1967,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "不知道跟别人说什么\nthat I don't know what to tell people."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 536333,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "但是当时多简单\nBack then, though, how simple it was."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 538966,
    "dDurationMs": 2767,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "然后我还发现一件特别有意思的事\nAnd then I noticed something really interesting:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 541733,
    "dDurationMs": 1633,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "就是你们看这些纸\nlook at these sheets of paper."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 544633,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "它们不是平的\nThey aren't flat."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 546833,
    "dDurationMs": 1767,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "它们凹凸不平\nThey're bumpy and uneven,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 549800,
    "dDurationMs": 1833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "因为当时写字\nbecause back then, when I wrote,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 551666,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我真的特别用力\nI really pressed down hard."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 554066,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "一笔一画都写得特别用力\nEvery single stroke was written with a lot of force,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 558033,
    "dDurationMs": 3367,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "每一笔都会压到后面几张纸上\nand every stroke pressed through onto the next few sheets."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 564566,
    "dDurationMs": 1267,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "其实你们可以看\nYou can actually see"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 565833,
    "dDurationMs": 4167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "现在我的中指这边还有一个老茧\nthat I still have a callus here on my middle finger."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 570766,
    "dDurationMs": 967,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "快没有了\nIt's almost gone now,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 571733,
    "dDurationMs": 1933,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "因为现在写字不太多\nbecause I don't write by hand much these days."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 573800,
    "dDurationMs": 2333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "但是这个老茧就是小时候用\nBut this callus is what's left from gripping the pen"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 576133,
    "dDurationMs": 4433,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "右手写字太用力抓笔留下的\nfar too tightly with my right hand as a child."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 582600,
    "dDurationMs": 666,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "所以啊\nSo yes —"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 583266,
    "dDurationMs": 4067,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我们中国人小时候学写中文也真的\nwe Chinese, as children, really do learn to write Chinese"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 587333,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "是一笔一画写出来、记下来的\nstroke by stroke, writing it out and committing it to memory."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 592433,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "告诉你们一个秘密\nLet me tell you a secret."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 594200,
    "dDurationMs": 2566,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "其实当时我们学汉字也\nWhen we were learning characters,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 596833,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "经常就是一个字一个词\nit was often a case of taking a single character or word"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 599433,
    "dDurationMs": 4067,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "要重复写30遍50遍\nand writing it out thirty or fifty times over."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 603500,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这是我们的作业\nThat was our homework."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 606000,
    "dDurationMs": 933,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我想\nI wonder:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 607033,
    "dDurationMs": 3167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "如果我也给我的学生布置这样的作业\nif I set my own students homework like that,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 611000,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "你们会接受吗？\nwould you accept it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 613266,
    "dDurationMs": 3267,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "第三篇，六年级的作文\nThe third one: a sixth-grade composition,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 616633,
    "dDurationMs": 1933,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "当时我12岁\nwhen I was twelve."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 619200,
    "dDurationMs": 2866,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这篇作文我必须要跟你们分享\nI absolutely have to share this one with you,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 622433,
    "dDurationMs": 2967,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "因为它和其他的作文不太一样\nbecause it's quite unlike the others."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 625766,
    "dDurationMs": 4700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我写的不再是花草小动物或者我自己\nI was no longer writing about plants, little animals or myself."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 630733,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这篇作文的题目叫\nThe title of this composition is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 633800,
    "dDurationMs": 3566,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "《我班同学一个月零花钱使用统计》\n\"A Survey of One Month of My Classmates' Pocket Money and How They Spend It\"."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 637833,
    "dDurationMs": 2633,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "随着同学们年龄的增长\nAs my classmates grow older,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 640866,
    "dDurationMs": 2567,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "所需要的东西越来越多\nthey need more and more things,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 643666,
    "dDurationMs": 3134,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "也要有属于自己的零花钱了\nand they need pocket money of their own."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 646800,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "你们觉不觉得有种HSK\nDoesn't it feel a bit like"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 649233,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "考试阅读理解的味道\na reading-comprehension passage from the HSK exam?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 652000,
    "dDurationMs": 2866,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "今天我调查20个身边的同学\nToday I surveyed twenty classmates around me"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 654866,
    "dDurationMs": 3534,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "的零花钱数量和使用情况\non how much pocket money they get and how they use it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 658533,
    "dDurationMs": 4900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "有50%的同学每月零花钱是100元以上\nFifty per cent of them get over 100 yuan a month"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 663533,
    "dDurationMs": 1633,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "500元以下的\nbut under 500 —"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 665200,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "是最多的\nthat's the largest group."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 667166,
    "dDurationMs": 4434,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "有15%的同学是500元及以上的\nFifteen per cent get 500 yuan or more,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 671766,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我个人认为这有点多了\nwhich personally I think is a bit too much."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 675833,
    "dDurationMs": 3567,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我还调查了他们零花钱的使用情况\nI also surveyed how they spend their pocket money."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 679800,
    "dDurationMs": 5133,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "有50%的学生使用零花钱主要买吃的\nFifty per cent of the students mainly spend it on food."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 685466,
    "dDurationMs": 2734,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "看来他们都是吃货啊\nIt seems they're all foodies."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 688633,
    "dDurationMs": 5233,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "有30%的学生是用来买自己喜欢\nThirty per cent use it to buy"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 693866,
    "dDurationMs": 3067,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "的乱七八糟的小玩意儿的\nall kinds of random little trinkets they like."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 697000,
    "dDurationMs": 3366,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "看来同学们不太喜欢学习啊\nIt seems my classmates don't much like studying;"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 700733,
    "dDurationMs": 2633,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "用在玩乐上的比较多\nthey spend more on having fun."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 704333,
    "dDurationMs": 3467,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "现在的我要敲敲当时的我的小脑袋\nToday's me wants to give little me a knock on the head."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 708433,
    "dDurationMs": 1167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "你这个人啊\nYou, girl —"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 709600,
    "dDurationMs": 1333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "怎么能这样想\nhow could you think like that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 711233,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "那么小的我们就应该花钱在玩乐上啊\nAt that age we absolutely should be spending money on having fun!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 714966,
    "dDurationMs": 2467,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "花那么多钱在学习上干嘛\nWhy spend all that money on studying?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 717533,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "后面那么多年等着花钱在学习上呢\nThere are so many years ahead of you for spending money on studying."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 722566,
    "dDurationMs": 634,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "唉\nUgh."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 723200,
    "dDurationMs": 4133,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "可能当时是为了讨好老师才这么写吧\nMaybe I only wrote that to please the teacher."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 727833,
    "dDurationMs": 4367,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我觉得家长不应该给予孩子太多钱\nI think parents shouldn't give children too much money."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 732566,
    "dDurationMs": 2634,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "父母赚钱也很辛苦的\nParents work hard for their money too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 735466,
    "dDurationMs": 3234,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "哎，到结尾就说教起来了\nOh dear, and at the end it turns into a lecture."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 738700,
    "dDurationMs": 866,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "不行\nThat won't do."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 739733,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "但这篇作文还真\nStill, this composition really is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 741333,
    "dDurationMs": 2633,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "有点像个小型的调查报告\na bit like a small survey report."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 744000,
    "dDurationMs": 1866,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "在这一个方面还是要\nOn that count I do have to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 745866,
    "dDurationMs": 1867,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "给当时的我点个赞\ngive little me a thumbs-up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 748433,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "小学的最后两年\nIn my last two years of primary school"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 750600,
    "dDurationMs": 3566,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我遇到了我当时非常喜欢的语文老师\nI had a Chinese teacher I absolutely adored."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 754766,
    "dDurationMs": 2567,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "现在看这些作文也能看到\nLooking at these compositions now, you can still see"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 757600,
    "dDurationMs": 2266,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "她当时多么会鼓励人\nhow good she was at encouraging people."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 760566,
    "dDurationMs": 2967,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "你们看这一篇她写了“好棒呀”\nLook, on this one she wrote \"Wonderful!\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 763633,
    "dDurationMs": 1433,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这边有个笑脸\nThere's a smiley face here,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 765433,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这边也有个笑脸\nand another smiley face here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 768433,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这边也说“丫头，真棒！”\nAnd over here: \"Kiddo, well done!\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 772966,
    "dDurationMs": 4067,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这边也说“相信你是好样的！” 笑脸\nAnd here: \"I'm sure you've got what it takes!\" — smiley face."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 777533,
    "dDurationMs": 4100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "所以我当时写作文也是充满了热情\nSo back then I wrote my compositions full of enthusiasm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 781666,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "会在上面画这种搞怪\nI'd draw these silly faces on them"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 783566,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "的表情和老师互动\nto interact with the teacher."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 785933,
    "dDurationMs": 2267,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "然后我上初中了\nThen I started junior high,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 788633,
    "dDurationMs": 2233,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我的语文老师变成了\nand my Chinese teacher became"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 790866,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "一个完全不同风格的老师\nsomeone with a completely different style."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 808633,
    "dDurationMs": 2233,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "更多圈圈点点\nMore circles and marks."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 811333,
    "dDurationMs": 2267,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "更多良而不是优\nMore \"good\"s instead of \"excellent\"s."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 814533,
    "dDurationMs": 3133,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "更多圈出的错别字\nMore miswritten characters circled,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 818133,
    "dDurationMs": 2467,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "圈出的用的不好的词语\nmore badly chosen words circled."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 821433,
    "dDurationMs": 1833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "当然完全可以理解\nWhich is completely understandable, of course,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 823266,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "因为到了初中\nbecause by junior high"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 824833,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我们对作文的要求更高\nthe standards for compositions are higher."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 827366,
    "dDurationMs": 1867,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "老师肯定希望我们作文\nThe teacher surely hoped our writing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 829233,
    "dDurationMs": 2767,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "的水平能上一个台阶\ncould move up a level —"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 832233,
    "dDurationMs": 1767,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "或者好几个台阶\nor several levels."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 834466,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "希望我们表达的东西更广更深\nShe hoped what we expressed would be broader and deeper."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 838800,
    "dDurationMs": 4066,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "现在看我那个阶段的写作并没有多差\nLooking at it now, my writing at that stage wasn't bad at all."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 843233,
    "dDurationMs": 3833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "但我可以清楚的记得当时我\nBut I clearly remember that back then"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 847066,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "对于写作文的热情并没有很高\nmy enthusiasm for writing compositions wasn't very high."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 850266,
    "dDurationMs": 2134,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "甚至是比较抗拒的\nI was even rather resistant to it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 852433,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我记得当时的老师好像也\nI remember my teacher back then didn't seem to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 855333,
    "dDurationMs": 2533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "不是很喜欢我的写作风格\nmuch like my writing style either."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 858533,
    "dDurationMs": 2933,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "当然这种东西本来就是很主观的嘛\nOf course, this sort of thing is subjective by nature."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 861766,
    "dDurationMs": 3067,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "但是还是有篇作文我想跟你们分享\nBut there's still one composition I want to share with you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 865166,
    "dDurationMs": 1567,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "第四篇作文\nThe fourth composition:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 866800,
    "dDurationMs": 1433,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "七年级的\nseventh grade,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 868466,
    "dDurationMs": 1967,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "13岁的我写的\nwritten when I was thirteen."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 871766,
    "dDurationMs": 2967,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "题目叫《罚抄的领悟》\nIt's called \"What Copying Lines Taught Me\"."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 876233,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "罚抄你们知道是什么东西吗？\nDo you know what fachao — copying as punishment — is?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 878933,
    "dDurationMs": 2133,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "就是惩罚你抄写\nIt means being punished by having to copy something out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 881200,
    "dDurationMs": 2033,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "就是你做错了一道题\nYou get a question wrong —"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 883466,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "尤其是那种你非常不应该错的\nespecially the kind you really shouldn't have got wrong —"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 886800,
    "dDurationMs": 3533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "老师为了让你深刻的记住这个错误\nand so that the mistake sticks firmly in your mind"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 890566,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "从错误中学习\nand you learn from it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 892666,
    "dDurationMs": 2467,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "会让你罚抄这个题目\nthe teacher makes you copy that question out over and over."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 895333,
    "dDurationMs": 2333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "那罚抄到底是怎样的体验呢？\nSo what is being made to copy lines actually like?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 897666,
    "dDurationMs": 1467,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我们来读一下吧\nLet's read it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 901866,
    "dDurationMs": 2967,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "今天数学作业发下来\nToday our maths homework was handed back,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 904866,
    "dDurationMs": 3467,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "上面有四个鲜红的字映入我眼帘\nand four bright red characters leapt into my eyes:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 908933,
    "dDurationMs": 1267,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "订正10遍\n\"Correct it ten times.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 911000,
    "dDurationMs": 3066,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我顿时感到跌到了万丈深渊\nI instantly felt as if I'd fallen into a bottomless abyss."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 914366,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "脸上一黑\nMy face went dark."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 917400,
    "dDurationMs": 3433,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "赶紧拿出本子奋笔疾书起来\nI quickly took out my notebook and started scribbling away furiously."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 921233,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "没过多久\nBefore long,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 922600,
    "dDurationMs": 1666,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我画了一半了\nwhen I was halfway through,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 924600,
    "dDurationMs": 1666,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "语文课开始了\nthe Chinese lesson began."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 926966,
    "dDurationMs": 2967,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "老师叫我们默新课文的单词\nThe teacher had us write out the new words from memory."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 930166,
    "dDurationMs": 2034,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这课单词都很难\nThe words in this lesson were all difficult,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 932200,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我还没预习就开默了\nand I hadn't even previewed them when the test started."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 935366,
    "dDurationMs": 1567,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "一共默5个\nThere were five words in all,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 936933,
    "dDurationMs": 1833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我就错了两个\nand I got two of them wrong."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 939266,
    "dDurationMs": 2767,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "全班只有几个同学全对\nIn the whole class only a few students got them all right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 942833,
    "dDurationMs": 1533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这里我要说一句\nHere I have to add something."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 944600,
    "dDurationMs": 1633,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "所以你们可以看到\nAs you can see,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 946800,
    "dDurationMs": 3433,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "中国人也很难记住一些字怎么写的\nChinese people also find it hard to remember how some characters are written."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 950733,
    "dDurationMs": 1700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "老师便很生气\nThe teacher got angry"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 952600,
    "dDurationMs": 3666,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "要求我们把课后的词语每个抄5遍\nand made us copy every word at the end of the lesson five times."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 956466,
    "dDurationMs": 2267,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我当时就傻眼了\nI was completely stunned."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 959133,
    "dDurationMs": 3067,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "下课后我使劲的抄写\nAfter class I copied away with all my might."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 962266,
    "dDurationMs": 2334,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "外面的朋友都在活动\nOutside, my friends were all out playing,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 965066,
    "dDurationMs": 2567,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我还是抑制住玩的欲望\nbut I held back the urge to join them,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 967866,
    "dDurationMs": 1967,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "笔头快速的移动\nmy pen tip moving fast."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 970833,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "终于在放学前\nFinally, before the end of the school day,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 972833,
    "dDurationMs": 2133,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我全部写完了\nI finished it all."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 975200,
    "dDurationMs": 1433,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "如释重负\nWhat a relief."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 976966,
    "dDurationMs": 3834,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "最搞笑的是当时的老师给我的评语是\nThe funniest part is the comment my teacher wrote:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 981133,
    "dDurationMs": 2067,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "吃一堑长一智\n\"A fall into the pit, a gain in your wit.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 984533,
    "dDurationMs": 1133,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "意思就是\nIt means that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 986000,
    "dDurationMs": 4233,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "当你从一个事情中间吃了教训\nonly once you've learnt your lesson the hard way from something"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 990266,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "你才能记住\nwill you actually remember it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 991833,
    "dDurationMs": 2167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "下次不再犯错误\nand not make the same mistake next time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 994233,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "接下来就是高中\nNext comes high school."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 996333,
    "dDurationMs": 1700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我记得到了高中\nI remember that by high school"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 998166,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我写作文的兴趣又上去了\nmy interest in writing compositions went back up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1001133,
    "dDurationMs": 2067,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我又比较喜欢写了\nI quite liked writing again,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1003433,
    "dDurationMs": 1767,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "因为当时遇到了欣赏\nbecause I'd found a teacher who appreciated"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1005200,
    "dDurationMs": 1833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我写作风格的老师\nmy writing style,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1007300,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "而且我也有非常多东西想讨论\nand because I had so many things I wanted to discuss,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1010433,
    "dDurationMs": 1533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "想去表达\nthings I wanted to express."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1012000,
    "dDurationMs": 2533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "你们也可以看到当时高中我\nYou can also see that in high school"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1014533,
    "dDurationMs": 2533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "的字迹发生了很大的变化\nmy handwriting changed a great deal."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1017433,
    "dDurationMs": 2033,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "其实还挺潦草的\nIt's actually pretty messy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1019766,
    "dDurationMs": 3167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "现在让我看有些字都\nNow there are characters that take me"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1022933,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "要花几秒才能看懂\na few seconds to work out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1026266,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "当时我写作的兴趣也发生了变化\nWhat interested me in writing changed then too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1029733,
    "dDurationMs": 1933,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我变得更理性了\nI became more rational."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1031666,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我喜欢去写议论文\nI liked writing argumentative essays."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1034266,
    "dDurationMs": 2767,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "当然议论文也是高中我们\nOf course, argumentative essays are exactly what"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1037033,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "才会着重去训练的东西\nwe only start training seriously in high school."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1041433,
    "dDurationMs": 3633,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我变得不那么喜欢写太长的故事\nI grew less fond of writing long stories."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1046000,
    "dDurationMs": 2633,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "反而我喜欢去抓住一个点\nInstead I liked to seize on a single point"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1048666,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "把它向深了挖\nand dig deep into it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1050833,
    "dDurationMs": 1367,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "向深了讨论\ndiscuss it in depth."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1052466,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "当时我还有一件很迷恋的事\nThere was something else I was infatuated with back then:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1055833,
    "dDurationMs": 4100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "就是喜欢把中文写的很高级\nI loved making my Chinese sound very sophisticated,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1060633,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "甚至比较艰深\neven rather abstruse."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1062933,
    "dDurationMs": 1700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "给你们来读一段\nLet me read you a passage."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1065366,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这应该是高二的作文本\nThis should be my second-year high-school notebook."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1069200,
    "dDurationMs": 3066,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "很奇怪，难道我们的内心世界\nHow strange. Shouldn't our inner world"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1072266,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "不应本就是自由国度吗？\nbe a free country to begin with?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1075966,
    "dDurationMs": 2034,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "何以就成了围城？\nHow did it become a besieged fortress?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1078766,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "而再回到我关闭朋友圈后\nAnd coming back to the question of why, after I shut down my WeChat Moments,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1081566,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "为什么会不安的问题\nI felt so uneasy:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1084400,
    "dDurationMs": 2633,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "究其因是我内心有鬼\nthe root of it is that I have a ghost inside me,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1087766,
    "dDurationMs": 2067,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "审视自己的邪鬼\nan evil ghost that scrutinises me,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1089900,
    "dDurationMs": 3233,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "而非什么手持天平的明眼人\nand not some clear-eyed judge holding a pair of scales."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1093600,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我自认为不可见之于人的东西\nWhat I consider must not be shown to others"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1097100,
    "dDurationMs": 4133,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "是我自己最不愿也最不敢直面之物\nis precisely what I am least willing and least daring to face myself."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1101300,
    "dDurationMs": 733,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "天呐\nOh my goodness."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1102033,
    "dDurationMs": 2367,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我这个语言也太复杂了\nMy language here is far too complicated."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1104800,
    "dDurationMs": 2433,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "就是它甚至不是现代人\nIt isn't even the kind of language people"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1107233,
    "dDurationMs": 2367,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "在写作时会常用的语言\ncommonly use when they write today."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1110066,
    "dDurationMs": 5434,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "它有点位于古代汉语和现代汉语之间\nIt sits somewhere between classical and modern Chinese."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1115500,
    "dDurationMs": 1633,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "现在我觉得高级的语言\nThese days I think sophisticated language"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1117133,
    "dDurationMs": 2933,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "反而是简单的清楚的\nis, on the contrary, simple and clear."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1120633,
    "dDurationMs": 2867,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "而且如果我还是用这么复杂的语言\nAnd if I still wrote in language this complicated,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1123633,
    "dDurationMs": 3133,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我是不可能去教人中文的\nthere'd be no way I could teach anyone Chinese."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1126900,
    "dDurationMs": 1366,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "但怎么办呢\nBut what could I do?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1128433,
    "dDurationMs": 3700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我当时就是喜欢这样的语言\nThat was simply the language I loved back then."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1132500,
    "dDurationMs": 2933,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我现在也不可能去批评当时的我\nAnd I can't very well criticise my younger self now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1135733,
    "dDurationMs": 5133,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "每个人在不同阶段都会有不同的想法\nEveryone has different ideas at different stages of life."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1140933,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "当时的我喜欢长句\nThe me of back then loved long sentences,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1142733,
    "dDurationMs": 1100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "喜欢引用\nloved quotations,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1144033,
    "dDurationMs": 2867,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "喜欢让一句话显得很有分量\nloved making a sentence feel weighty."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1147466,
    "dDurationMs": 4067,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "觉得一句话长、复杂就等于深刻\nI thought a long, complex sentence equalled profundity."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1152200,
    "dDurationMs": 3766,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "所以从小学到高中\nSo, from primary school to high school,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1157000,
    "dDurationMs": 4300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我的中文写作水平到底变了多少呢？\njust how much did my Chinese writing really change?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1162300,
    "dDurationMs": 1133,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我只能说\nAll I can say is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1163433,
    "dDurationMs": 3533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我看到的变化不是一条线性的变化\nthe change I see isn't a linear one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1167300,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "也不是说我的水平越来越高\nNor is it that my level kept climbing higher"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1170333,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我的写作越来越高级的变化\nand my writing kept getting more sophisticated."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1174100,
    "dDurationMs": 2466,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我看到的更多是我和\nWhat I see is more the change in the relationship"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1176566,
    "dDurationMs": 2467,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "写作之间关系的变化\nbetween me and writing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1179133,
    "dDurationMs": 2533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "觉得看到这些对你们来说\nI think seeing all this"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1181666,
    "dDurationMs": 2634,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "应该也挺有意思的\nshould be quite interesting for you too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1184500,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "也许这可以让你们感受到\nPerhaps it can give you a sense that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1187600,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "学一门语言不仅仅是\nlearning a language isn't only about"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1190200,
    "dDurationMs": 3366,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "从简单走向高级，或者走向复杂\ngoing from simple to advanced, or towards complexity."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1194733,
    "dDurationMs": 3033,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "它更多是让你去慢慢的学会\nIt's much more about slowly learning"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1198233,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "怎么更好的去用语言表达自己\nhow to use the language to express yourself better,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1202566,
    "dDurationMs": 1267,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "表现自己\nto show who you are;"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1204233,
    "dDurationMs": 3167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "怎么让你去感受\nand about how you come to feel,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1207966,
    "dDurationMs": 1167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "越来越多\nmore and more,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1209333,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "越来越深\nmore and more deeply,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1210333,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "你和这门你学习的语言之间的连接\nthe connection between you and the language you're learning."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1215166,
    "dDurationMs": 900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "说到这里\nSpeaking of which,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1216066,
    "dDurationMs": 1300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我也很好奇\nI'm curious:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1217633,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "在你们的母语考试中间\nin exams in your own native language,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1221433,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "写作有多重要呢？\nhow important is writing?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1224433,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "它让你害怕？\nDoes it frighten you,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1226166,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "还是让你兴奋？\nor does it excite you?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1227733,
    "dDurationMs": 3133,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "你们需要训练写作的时间多吗？\nDo you have to spend a lot of time practising writing?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1231433,
    "dDurationMs": 2133,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "你们又是怎么训练的呢？\nAnd how do you practise?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1233733,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "也会有这么多作文本吗？\nDo you end up with this many composition notebooks too?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1237700,
    "dDurationMs": 2533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "其实今天带你们看的只是\nWhat I've shown you today is really only"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1240233,
    "dDurationMs": 2367,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这些作文里的很小一部分\na very small part of these compositions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1242933,
    "dDurationMs": 1967,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "里面还有其他很多东西\nThere's plenty more inside:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1244900,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "比如一些奇怪的作文题目\nsome strange composition titles, for instance,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1247900,
    "dDurationMs": 1433,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "老师的评语\nthe teachers' comments,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1249533,
    "dDurationMs": 2333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "还有很多我现在都完全\nand lots of things I now have absolutely no memory"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1251866,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "不记得自己写过的东西\nof ever having written."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1255200,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "如果你们喜欢\nIf you enjoyed this,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1256633,
    "dDurationMs": 3767,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我之后还可以再出一期相关的视频\nI could make another video on the subject later on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1260633,
    "dDurationMs": 2567,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "比如我们可以来一期视频\nFor example, we could do an episode"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1263200,
    "dDurationMs": 2133,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "专门看一看中国的\nlooking specifically at how Chinese"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1265333,
    "dDurationMs": 2167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "学生是怎么写作文的\nstudents write their compositions,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1267700,
    "dDurationMs": 1566,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "或者看一看中国的\nor at how Chinese"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1269266,
    "dDurationMs": 2534,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "老师是怎么批改作文的\nteachers mark them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1272066,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "那今天的视频就到这里结束了\nAnd that's it for today's video."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1275466,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我们下期视频再见吧，拜拜\nSee you in the next one. Bye-bye!"
    } ]
  } ]
}
